1
00:00:00,876 --> 00:00:04,546
(Amy:)If playing that game is more important
than honoring your commitment to me...

2
00:00:04,713 --> 00:00:07,093
(Amy:)...and you don't mind me showing up
all by myseIf...

3
00:00:07,258 --> 00:00:10,008
...after l've told everybody
I'll be bringing somebody...

4
00:00:10,177 --> 00:00:11,807
(Amy:)...then fine, go home and play your game.

5
00:00:14,557 --> 00:00:18,397
Thanks. Oh, listen.

6
00:00:19,061 --> 00:00:21,731
l wouldn't mind a piece of birthday cake...

7
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:26,067
(Sheldon:)...provided the old gal's candle blow
is clean and dry.

8
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:37,707
Here you go. L've got everything
we'll need for the big game.

9
00:00:37,871 --> 00:00:40,911
Low-fat turkey jerky.

10
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:43,423
(Raj:)Low-carb beer.

11
00:00:43,711 --> 00:00:46,591
Hundred-calorie snack packs.

12
00:00:47,548 --> 00:00:50,928
(Leonard:)Pick up a Y chromosome while
you were there? You might be short one.

13
00:00:51,594 --> 00:00:54,724
Hey, I plan on leveling up in the game,
not my swimsuit size...

